# Constraints

*Durable rules · do not violate · gravity HIGH · stable across all slices*

---

## Trust principle

```
AI prepares · humans approve
```

Every UI affordance reinforces this. Never bypass. Never auto-send.

---

## Data

```
synthetic only             no real CUI · IBAN · names · addresses · companies
canonical demo company     Atelier Nova SRL  (Pitești · 12 employees)
no parallel demo companies invented mid-stream
```

---

## Tone

```
do      calm · concrete · practical · trustworthy · Romanian-aware
do not  transformation · revolutionary · next-generation · empower · AI-powered innovation
```

Reference: `romanian_sme_ai_companion_promotion_go_to_market_pack.md` §4 (don't-say) · §5 (do-say).

---

## Language

```
UI copy · README · code     English
demo documents              Romanian (do not translate)
example accountant emails   Romanian
```

---

## Stack (settled)

```
frontend   SvelteKit · Svelte 5 · TypeScript · Tailwind · runes for state
backend    FastAPI · Pydantic · SQLAlchemy/SQLModel · Alembic
database   PostgreSQL + pgvector  (no separate vector DB in MVP)
storage    local FS first · MinIO when needed
queue      FastAPI BackgroundTasks first · Redis+Celery when needed
```

---

## Visual

```
palette    muted dark gray · diagrams.md style guide
           bg #2f3437  main #3d4448  action #4b5256  data #25292c
           stroke #8a8f93 / #b2b8bc  text #f2f2f2
mood       calm · light · not overdesigned · trustworthy
```

---

## Prompt hygiene

```
runtime prompts versioned    v1 · v1.1 · v2
never silently rewrite       bump version + record what/why changed
inline version line          embed once slice-3 wires real AI
                             format: # prompt: <name> v<version>
registry source of truth     project_control_pack.md §23.5
```

---

## MVP exclusions (load-bearing)

```
no autonomous email sending
no automatic payments
no ANAF / SPV / e-Factura integration
no ERP integration
no fine-tuning
no multi-tenant enterprise permissions
no mobile app
```

Reference: `romanian_sme_ai_companion_project_control_pack.md` §23.2 (MVP boundary).

---

